Description: Terminal reimplementation of SQL Server Management Studio
 goSSMS is a portable, cross-platform terminal TUI reimplementation of
 SQL Server Management Studio. It connects to Microsoft SQL Server
 2016 SP1 and later, and offers an object explorer, a query editor
 with results grids, execution plans, and property sheets for server
 and database objects.
 .
 The binary is statically linked and has no runtime dependencies.

